  "notes": {
    "made": "--init (frames, waist, below), then by hand (round 3: 「后面的英雄都按这个思路来 先去联盟客户端找英雄的特色是什么 再做run的动画」): lock head - his drawn run (Codex's whole-frame redraw) redraws the upper body every frame, so only the head is one drawing (Ezreal v2's way); the barrel on his back, its strap, the arms, the belly, the lower beard and the legs stay each frame's own drawing",
    "head": "frame 5's bald dome, face (open laughing mouth, as his idle's: colour-IoU 0.47 against hd_idle_base[0], the closest) and the beard down to row 24 (the strap's buckle and the beard's lower end stay each frame's own); the drawn heads are 8 drawings (IoU 0.29-0.82: frames 1-4 alike, 0 / 5 / 6 / 7 each its own - the eyes, the mouth and the whiskers redrawn), all 3/4 to the right",
    "chin": "frame 5's first row under the locked part (the beard runs on under it as each frame draws it)",
    "bob": "the drawn one (the head where each frame drew its own: matched on the whole head, the beard's red leading)",
    "waist": "--init's (not used by the head lock)",
    "keep_one": "his 1x run is a drawing of its own (ppu_one's from the dense frames differs in 1160-1246 squares a frame, the untouched frame 5 too): it stays as installed (assets/source/gragas/hd/gragas_run_one.png, from 33c4a229b), only hd_run and lo_run are made",
    "variants": "char: no head_align (the head goes where its colours match the frame's own head; aligning on the beard's end would move the face with the beard's length); chin_rows = the row over the locked part's lower edge at each frame's matched place (the clearing stops there: the lower beard stays); clear_all, clear_grow 3 (the drawn whiskers reach 3 squares past frame 5's); clear_poly: the clearing stops at the strap's line (the shoulder's skin left of it stays square for square); keep_colours = the strap's and the barrel's browns and the barrel's metal (left of the face and under the chin); skin = every warm skin shade the frames use (62); fill_skip = the skin, the browns, the metal and the eye white: what the clearing leaves by the strap is closed with outline, by the beard filled from the beard - no skin or brown patch",
    "init": {
      "contacts": "frames [2, 5] (feet's band spread [28, 18, 34, 37, 32, 38, 27, 38])",
      "waist": "row -2 from the centre in every frame: per-row differing share passes 0.669 there (figure rows -48..19)",
      "from": "frame 6: closest to hd_idle_base[0] (alike share per frame [0.262, 0.195, 0.172, 0.19, 0.2, 0.492, 0.314, 0.236]; fits every frame: [1, 3, 6])",
      "below": "rects per frame [2, 2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 0] (her squares under the waist her feet do not reach)",
      "chains": "hair: 5 colours behind the face (root column 8), 36 squares",
      "bob": "3 squares low to high (1.86 game px), low the frame after the contacts [2, 5], moved by -2 so the head stays in every rect: [0, -2, -1, 1, 0, -2, -1, 1]",
      "undecided": [
        "a knee or a foot raised over the waist row goes under the laid body: check the review's frames",
        "parts that lag the body (fists, a held weapon): none set - add `parts` (a polygon each in frame 6) where the hero holds something by the body",
        "a cape or a tail: not looked for - add a chain by hand"
      ]
    },
    "undecided": []
  },
  "keep_one": "assets/source/gragas/hd/gragas_run_one"
